WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.800
- Okay. So I have to ask you,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.890
did you ever ask him about
Batman? Cause I would have.

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:06.296
And I'm 39.

00:00:06.296 --> 00:00:08.160
(everyone laughing)

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.030
- The first scene I filmed with him,

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.170
when they were like,
rearranging the cameras

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:13.870
and stuff like that,

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.306
I was sitting right
next to him in a chair.

00:00:16.306 --> 00:00:17.780
So we were leaning forward

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.340
'cause the camera was like right here.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.340
I was like, "So how's playing Batman?"

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.768
And he just told me all about it.

00:00:22.768 --> 00:00:24.900
He said he had to wear this suit,

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.208
he was sweating and it was heavy.

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:30.086
(everyone laughing)

00:00:30.086 --> 00:00:30.919
- [Kelly] Sound's not fun.

00:00:30.919 --> 00:00:31.952
- [Robert] Don't give
away too many secrets.

00:00:31.952 --> 00:00:32.930
(everyone laughing)

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.610
- It doesn't look like it breathes well.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:36.810
I just thought it was so cool,

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.010
like to be able to sit by Batman.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.670
I know my kid met Aquaman once,

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.500
and he like, it's like the
coolest thing he's ever done.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.490
So I just thought

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:43.323
(laughing)

00:00:43.323 --> 00:00:44.240
- Jason Momoa, he's just spectacular.

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.550
- But it's so funny how
your kids become like,

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:48.490
you seem like you do
well in this situation.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:49.860
My kids, all of a sudden, like,

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.590
the loudest kids on the
planet will like, not speak.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:53.423
- They clam up.

00:00:53.423 --> 00:00:54.990
- And I'm like, what's
happening to you right now.

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:57.470
- No, no. I took my daughters
to meet Taylor Swift,

00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:58.500
and they're...

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.333
What are you talk talking about?

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:01.179
We came all the way here
to meet Taylor Swift.

00:01:01.179 --> 00:01:02.540
Say something.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.380
- You look like a liar.

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:06.910
- I'm telling you they're
fans. You know what I mean.

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:08.078
(everyone laughing)

00:01:08.078 --> 00:01:08.911
- You look like a liar. You're like,

00:01:08.911 --> 00:01:09.968
I swear they know your songs.

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:11.833
(laughing)

